---
layout: "layouts/site.njk"
title: "About TJ"
description: "Tifa Jade is a Tri-Cities, WA director, producer, and content strategist. For over a decade, she has made video for global brands and local businesses alike."
permalink: "/about/"
jsonLd:
  "@context": "https://schema.org"
  "@type": "ProfilePage"
  name: "About TJ"
  url: "https://tifajade.com/about/"
  mainEntity:
    "@type": "Person"
    name: "Tifa Jade"
    alternateName: "TJ"
    jobTitle: "Film Director, Video Producer and Content Strategist"
    url: "https://tifajade.com/"
    image: "https://tifajade.com/assets/img/about/tj-headshot.webp"
    workLocation: "Tri-Cities, Washington"
# Set to true to bring back the ten-chapter story below
showStory: false
# Write the bio here: one string per paragraph (two or three work best)
bio:
  - "I grew up making backyard movies with a camcorder and a dream. I brought that same wonder and excitement about film into my career, being named Spokane International Film Festival's Most Promising Filmmaker and seeing my work shortlisted for the Student Academy Awards."
  - "I went on to launch a career in video production as an editor for the UFC, and carried my passion for documentary storytelling into the work I pursue today. At Good Loser Media, I capture stories about the people working to make life better for everyone. And in my work with global brands and local businesses, my deep roots within the communities I serve help me make the best possible work for your audience."
beliefs:
  - title: "Real people, not AI"
    copy: "The best local stories are in your shop, your team, and your actual customers. Generated AI content looks cheap and devalues your brand."
  - title: "Research before the camera"
    copy: "I learn who you serve and what makes them choose you before a single shot is planned."
  - title: "One shoot, every screen"
    copy: "I frame every shot for TV, the web, and social, so one day on set produces a month of content."
  - title: "Local first"
    copy: "I grew Good Loser Media by showing up for the community, and I bring the same approach to your business."
---

{%- set cdn = "https://tifajade.b-cdn.net/About%20Me/" -%}
<section class="section about-hero">
  <div class="container about-hero__inner">
    <div class="about-hero__text">
      <p class="label" data-reveal>About TJ</p>
      <h1 class="display" data-split>
        I'm Tifa Jade, but you can call me <span class="flourish">TJ.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="lede" data-reveal>
        I'm a director, producer, and content strategist in the Tri-Cities, WA.
        For over a decade I've made video for global brands and local businesses
        alike.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="frame frame--portrait about-hero__photo" data-reveal>
      <img
        src="/assets/img/about/tj-headshot.webp"
        alt="Portrait of Tifa Jade smiling, resting their chin on one hand, in front of a green leaf wall"
        width="1000"
        height="1500"
        fetchpriority="high"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/logo-ticker.njk" %}

{#- Hidden until the bio is written: it is skipped while the first paragraph is still the placeholder -#}
{%- if bio and "to be written" not in bio[0] %}
<section class="section about-bio">
  <div class="container about-bio__grid">
    <h2 class="headline" data-split>
      The short <span class="flourish">version.</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="about-bio__text" data-reveal>
      {%- for para in bio %}
      <p>{{ para }}</p>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}

<section class="section about-beliefs-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 class="headline" data-split>
        How I think about the <span class="flourish">work.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="about-beliefs" role="list" data-reveal-stagger>
      {%- for b in beliefs %}
      <li class="about-belief" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="about-belief__title">{{ b.title }}</h3>
        <p class="about-belief__copy">{{ b.copy }}</p>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{%- if showStory %}
<section class="section about" data-about-story>
  <div class="container about-story">
    <div class="about-story__media" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="frame">
        {%- for ch in about %} {#- Nothing loads until a chapter is on screen;
        the script starts each loop -#}
        <video
          muted
          loop
          playsinline
          preload="none"
          data-chapter-video="{{ loop.index0 }}"
          {%
          if
          loop.first
          %}
          class="is-active"
          {%
          endif
          %}
        >
          <source src="{{ cdn }}{{ ch.video }}.webm" type="video/webm" />
          <source
            src="{{ cdn }}{{ ch.video }}_h264_preview.mp4"
            type="video/mp4"
          />
        </video>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="about-counter label">
        <span data-chapter-current>01</span> / {{ about.length | pad2 }}
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="about-story__chapters" role="list">
      {%- for ch in about %}
      <li
        class="chapter{% if loop.last %} chapter--last{% endif %}"
        data-chapter="{{ loop.index0 }}"
      >
        <div class="frame frame--portrait chapter__media" aria-hidden="true">
          <video muted loop playsinline preload="none">
            <source src="{{ cdn }}{{ ch.video }}.webm" type="video/webm" />
            <source
              src="{{ cdn }}{{ ch.video }}_h264_preview.mp4"
              type="video/mp4"
            />
          </video>
        </div>
        <p class="label chapter__place" data-reveal>
          {{ loop.index | pad2 }} · {{ ch.place }}
        </p>
        <h2 class="chapter__title" data-split>{{ ch.title }}</h2>
        <div class="prose" data-reveal>
          <p>{{ ch.copy | safe }}</p>
        </div>
        {%- if loop.last %}
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--primary btn--large" data-reveal
          >Let's talk</a
        >
        {%- endif %}
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %} {#- Temporary filler while the story is hidden -#} {% include
"partials/who-and-how.njk" %}

<section class="section about-work">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="label" data-reveal>Work with me</p>
    <h2 class="headline" data-split>
      Let's make something your community
      <span class="flourish">remembers.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="lede" data-reveal>
      Tell me about your business, your campaign, or your idea. I'll tell you how
      I'd approach it.
    </p>
    <div class="cluster" data-reveal>
      <a
        href="{{ site.booking.url }}"
        class="btn btn--primary btn--large"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        data-booking="{{ site.booking.calLink }}"
        >{{ site.booking.label }}</a
      >
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--large">Start a project</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
